QA note: an earlier attempt in this same session (Eco Market, store_id=19) produced a misleading "Fresh local" render — root-caused to the QA driver's own Undo tap missing the 3s snackbar window (adb screenshot/dump round-trip too slow), NOT an app defect: logcat confirms zero POST /wish-list/add call was ever sent for that attempt, and the DB shows no new row for store_id=19 — the render simply reverted to the two untouched pre-existing favourites (Fresh local id=12, NEARS600 id=4117) because the optimistic remove's UI state was never followed by a real restore. Re-run with a tap-timing fix (single-shot dump+tap, <1s) on both a store and an item confirmed the fix works correctly.
